      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm prepping for a moot court competition and i'm stuck on the oral arguments for the executive privilege topic. basically, looking at modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? i need you to actually pick the stronger legal position for my opening statement. which side has the better case?",
