    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. you mentioned the privilege protects the process from \"invaders from the political left and right.\" that sounds like a pretty heavy way to put it. are you saying that congressional oversight is inherently just a partisan tool to weaken the presidency, rather than a legitimate constitutional function?",
      "source": "evaluator"
